%% Figure 3 — Timeline of native 1-bit / 1.58-bit LLM research, 2023-2026.
%% Source: ../data/inventory.csv (year + id). Grouped by theme; regenerate before camera-ready.
timeline
  title From BitLinear to the Edge  (2023 - 2026 H1)
  section 2023
    Foundations : BitNet - BitLinear, 1-bit from scratch (2310.11453)
                : PB-LLM - first LLM binarisation for compression (2310.00034)
                : TSLD - first ternary QAT of large generative LMs
  section 2024
    Native ternary : BitNet b1.58 - ternary, FP16 parity from ~3B (2402.17764)
                   : Spectra / TriLM - open ternary suite 99M-3.9B
                   : MatMul-free LM - remove attention matmul (2406.02528)
    PTQ toward 1-bit : BiLLM (1.08-bit) - BinaryMoS - DB-LLM - OneBit - ARB-LLM - FBI-LLM
    Systems : bitnet.cpp / 1-bit AI Infra 1.1 - CPU ternary kernels
    Analysis : Scaling Laws for Precision - QiD (undertrained-LLM favouring) - theory of 1-bit NNs
  section 2025
    BitNet line : BitNet b1.58 2B4T - first open native 2B model, 4T tokens (2504.12285)
                : BitNet a4.8 (4-bit activations) - BitNet v2 (Hadamard, native A4)
    Training theory : QuEST (stable W1A1) - CAGE (curvature-aware STE) - ParetoQ (unified 1-4 bit)
    Ternary PTQ : PTQTP - PT2-LLM - Tequila - PTQ1.61 - ICQuant
    Applications : BitVLA (robotics) - BitTTS - one-bit ASR - BitNet Distillation - MoTE (ternary MoE)
    Systems / HW : Spectra 1.1 TriRun GPU kernel - PIM-LLM - BitROM - TeLLMe - TerEffic
  section 2026 H1
    New bit-widths : Sparse-BitNet (N:M) - Sherry (1.25-bit) - NanoQuant / LittleBit (sub-1-bit)
    Rotation PTQ : HARP - TWLA - BWLA (first W1A6) - influence-Walsh rotations
    Ternary Mamba - BitNet Text Embeddings - Fairy2i (pretrained -> complex 2-bit)
    HW accelerators : TOM (compute-in-ROM) - Platinum (LUT-ASIC) - T-SAR (SIMD-ISA) - Vec-LUT
    Analysis : "Fitting is not enough" (smoothness) - extreme-low-bit reasoning failure modes
  section cutoff
    30 June 2026 : literature cutoff - later work in the living appendix
